WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:11.845
German tobacco. Last one. Too bad.

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:17.142
I know how you feel.
The same thing happened to me.

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:21.855
You visit Germany, yes? Dessau.

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:25.358
You must be Sherlock Holmes.

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:27.944
You are an engineer.

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:32.532
You read German magazines.
Magazines about airplanes.

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:36.119
All Japanese engineers visit Dessau.

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:40.081
You're exactly right.

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:45.378
-Dr. Junkers is in trouble.
-What kind of trouble?

00:00:48.006 --> 00:00:51.134
He fights the government. He will blow up.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:53.595
Mr. Hitler's government?

00:00:54.637 --> 00:00:57.390
The Nazis are a gang of hoodlums.

00:00:58.099 --> 00:01:00.268
This is a good place.

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:04.814
No mosquitoes. Not hot. Good watercress.

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:07.609
A good place to forget bad things.

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:10.445
Cigarette? I'm afraid they're Japanese.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:11.613
Thank you.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:21.664
It is a nice night.
"Hier ist der Zauberberg."

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:23.750
"The Magic Mountain." By Thomas Mann?

00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:26.127
A good place for forgetting.

00:01:26.878 --> 00:01:29.798
Make a war in China. Forget it.

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:32.759
Make a puppet state
in Manchuria. Forget it.

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:36.513
Quit the League of Nations. Forget it.

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:39.015
Make the world your enemy. Forget it.

00:01:39.974 --> 00:01:41.893
Japan will blow up.

00:01:42.894 --> 00:01:44.771
Germany will blow up too.

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:49.526
-Will Germany go to war again?
-Yes. They must be stopped.

